# React Native Service Layer

- RTK Query for cached/shared server data; axios services for one-off uploads/downloads/commands.
- Components use generated hooks or typed wrappers only.
- Validate responses with zod and map failures to `AppError`.
- Tokens are read from expo-secure-store in api-client, never UI.
- Retry refresh once on 401; then clear session.
- Respect offline state and stale data.
- Public config uses `EXPO_PUBLIC_`; secrets never ship in JS/app config/public EAS env.
